  "description": "QAGQAS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H174 Co4 Gd6 N2 O46 P6. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Co1B (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co2B (Co) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.190-4.122 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.41-126.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H174Co4Gd6N2O46P6. Article name explicitly identifies Co(II), Gd(III).",
